OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CNI doctors' strike due to end, with    
OL,5,Cseparate walkout planned for Monday    
OL,6,GA 24-hour strike by resident doctors   
OL,7,Gin Northern Ireland is due to end at   
OL,8,G07:00 GMT on Saturday.                 
OL,10,FBut consultants and specialist doctors 
OL,11,Fwill begin a separate 24-hour strike   
OL,12,Fon Monday, as part of the same pay     
OL,13,Fdispute.                               
OL,15,FThe British Medical Association (BMA)  
OL,16,Frejected a recommended 3.5% pay rise   
OL,17,Fand wants to restore the value of      
OL,18,Fdoctors' pay to 2008 levels.           
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
