OL,4,CMan jailed for non-fatal strangulation 
OL,5,Cand domestic abuse                     
OL,6,GA 41-year-old man has been jailed for  
OL,7,G16-and-a-half months for threatening   
OL,8,Gto burn his ex-partners house down     
OL,9,Gwith her inside and for strangling her 
OL,10,Gwith a car seatbelt.                   
OL,12,FGary Oscroft of Clifton House in North 
OL,13,FQueen Street has 147 previous          
OL,14,Fconvictions on his record.             
OL,16,FOscroft previously pleaded guilty to   
OL,17,Fcharges of domestic abuse and non-     
OL,18,Ffatal strangulation or asphyxiation.   
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
